      'Stash: new "Sort" (page) and "Sort all" buttons (whole stash by category and quality, no gaps, empty pages freed) and a "Stash all" button under the Character panel (worn gear, active charms, belt and quest items stay; potions and keys kept by default), with a confirmation and an "Undo" for a few seconds.',
