      'Maps: no more black patches along the walls. The floor is now drawn under and behind the walls of indoor maps, and along the edges of void maps.',
      'Music: the game no longer shows up as an Android media player and no longer pauses Spotify or other apps; music now plays through Web Audio, and nothing is loaded when music volume is 0.',
      "Upgrade / Crafting menu: the floating list now sits to the left of the item sheet instead of covering it, so the map's stats stay visible while you choose.",
      'Ethereal items: the name of ethereal normal and superior items is shown in grey on the ground and in the tooltip, like in Diablo II (with the "Eth." prefix).',
      "Loot: exceptional tiers now follow a curated list of truly sought-after items (uniques, sets, runewords, ethereal socketed bases, charms, well-rolled jewelry) instead of every elite item. Stone of Jordan, Raven Frost, Dwarf Star, Skullder's Ire, Enigma, Infinity… stand out as exceptional; uninteresting uniques no longer get a beam.",
