      'Stash: item search across all pages (name, type, modifiers, runes, sockets, quality), quick filters, non-matching items dimmed, result counter, page markers, clickable result list and next / previous result.',
      'Maps: a remaining-monsters counter now shows next to the map name ("50+ monsters" when more than 50 are left, otherwise the exact number); it counts living monsters and those of groups that have not appeared yet.',
      "Larzuk's Puzzle Pieces: map bosses drop them (10% at Normal, 16% Fast, 22% Very fast, 35% Abundant per boss; half as often for Hell campaign bosses). Ten pieces make a Puzzle Box (sockets on a unique or set item); they also drop, rarely, from ordinary monsters.",
      'Loot filter: new Tiers tab. Move any item to another tier (5 grail, 4 exceptional, 3 useful or none): search, categories, multi-select, up/down buttons, reset to default. Beam, colour, announcement and sound update immediately, including for items already on the ground. A tier change never reveals an item hidden by the filter.',
      'Ground: fixed the black lines that appeared between ground tiles while moving (each tile now slightly overlaps its neighbours).',
