      'Rendering engine (Settings › Display): WebGL (default) or experimental WebGPU, applied on the next launch with a "Reload now" button. If WebGPU is unavailable or fails, the game falls back to WebGL and remembers the failure on this device. Image quality (sharpness, scaling, mood) is not available under WebGPU.',
      'Maps: when the map stash is full (200), auto-pickup no longer puts maps in the bag: they stay on the ground, with a message. Manual pickup (tapping the map) still works.',
